e victory  The Hound overcomes his fear of fire and  sends them both tumbling over the  ramparts of the red key finally getting  an appropriate revenge for when the  mountain as a child shoved the Hound  into a fire and left him scarred for  life check out one of our newest videos  right here plus even more looper videos  about your favorite stuff are coming  soon subscribe to our YouTube channel  and hit the bell so you don't miss a  single one  [Music]

